{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白羯磨二十四、白二羯磨四十七、白四羯磨三十，因羯磨不限百一，以類相從不出百一，羯磨之法要須曲盡乃成\n羯磨，今粗略法用可知耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四處即是內界，以故不除。此處內難失衣之罪，是以後結衣中應除"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結界法先應規度內界相，內界相中規度外界相，先結外界後結內界，所以外界在內者，\n或有住處不須外界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能作法人、能分僧臥具人、能敷僧臥具人、能分僧餅人、能處分\n差請人、處分沙彌人、能分僧粥人、能處分守園人、能分僧衣人、能分雨衣人、主分藥人、晝夜掌僧物人、掌僧麁物人、\n常守住處人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四略出二人，其餘法用可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨時下意作眾事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "波利婆沙中應具說三羯磨，相承之法如下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六夜苦行下意作眾事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此出罪羯磨要二十人前，三羯磨四人可得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切偷羅遮從二篇生四差之異，上品不可懺；前篇下品、後篇中品，界外\n四人得懺；之餘下品人一得懺也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "麁罪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是\n三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧答聽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲作羯磨時依如白中，但誰忍為異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事多未說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "檀越施一切僧，應用此羯磨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜受自恣人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長老應言：「一心自撿。」答言：「當漸漸學之。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長老皆應若優毘聽"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489002", "target": null, "type": "orig", "text": "此下宋元明宮四本有失譯人名今附宋錄八字，但上註宋本元本宮本俱無人名二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0917_p0914c24"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Q22_p0513c05"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0917_p0914c24"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Q22_p0514a10"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0917_p0915b19"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489001", "type": "mod", "text": "一卷【大】＊，〔－〕【明】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489003", "type": "mod", "text": "四【大】，二【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489004", "type": "mod", "text": "十【大】，十二【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489005", "type": "mod", "text": "諸【大】，誰【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489006", "type": "mod", "text": "長老【大】下同，諸長老【宋】【元】【明】【宮】下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489007", "type": "mod", "text": "處分【大】，能分處【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489008", "type": "mod", "text": "處分【大】，分處【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489009", "type": "mod", "text": "二【CB】【磧-CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，一【大】，一【麗-CB】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489010", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0489010", "type": "mod", "text": "比丘【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0490001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0490001", "type": "mod", "text": "尸【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0490002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0490002", "type": "mod", "text": "日【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0490003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0490003", "type": "mod", "text": "承【大】，乘【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0490004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0490004", "type": "mod", "text": "磨【大】＊，摩【宋】＊【元】＊【明】＊【宮】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0490005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0490005", "type": "mod", "text": "事【大】，〔－〕【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0490006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0490006", "type": "mod", "text": "云【大】，言【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492001", "type": "mod", "text": "篇【大】＊，偏【宮】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492002", "type": "mod", "text": "人一【大】，一人【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492003", "type": "mod", "text": "如是三說【大】，如是三說【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492004", "type": "mod", "text": "若【大】，者【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492005", "type": "mod", "text": "當【大】，畜【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492006", "type": "mod", "text": "見【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492007", "type": "mod", "text": "見【大】，〔－〕【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492008", "type": "mod", "text": "見罪【大】，〔－〕【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0492009", "type": "mod", "text": "不作如法懺【大】，如法懺不作【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0493001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0493001", "type": "mod", "text": "伽【大】下同，迦【宋】【元】【明】【宮】下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0493002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0493002", "type": "mod", "text": "祇【大】＊，秖【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0493003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0493003", "type": "mod", "text": "非【大】，作【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0493004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0493004", "type": "mod", "text": "說【大】，訖【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0493005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0493005", "type": "mod", "text": "長老【大】＊，諸長老【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0493006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0493006", "type": "mod", "text": "比丘【大】，沙彌【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0494001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0494001", "type": "mod", "text": "聽【大】，僧聽【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0494002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0494002", "type": "mod", "text": "是罪【大】，罪是【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0494003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0494003", "type": "mod", "text": "言【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0495001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0495001", "type": "mod", "text": "僧【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0495002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0495002", "type": "mod", "text": "時到【CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，到時【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0495003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0495003", "type": "mod", "text": "受歲【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0495004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0495004", "type": "mod", "text": "受【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0495005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0495005", "type": "mod", "text": "大沙門百一羯磨法一卷【大】，百一羯磨文十誦【宋】【元】，百一羯磨文【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0489001", "type": "orig", "text": "〔一卷〕－【明】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0489002", "type": "orig", "text": "此下宋元明宮四本有失譯人名今附宋錄八字，但上註宋本元本宮本俱無人名二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0489003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0489003", "type": "orig", "text": "四＝二【宮】"}
