{"id": null, "n": "0492008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0492008", "type": "orig", "text": "〔見罪〕－【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0492009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0492009", "type": "orig", "text": "不作如法懺＝如法懺不作【三】"}
